---
/**
 * The client/server split. This section exists to make the "agents survive the
 * window closing" claim credible — without it, that reads as marketing.
 */
---

<section class="section section--tight arch" id="architecture">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="arch__grid">
      <div class="arch__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2>A tmux-style split, with a native front end</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          A headless <strong>daemon</strong> owns the agent PTYs, the per-agent worktrees, the
          attention state and the split-pane tree. The <strong>macOS app</strong> is a client: it
          embeds a libghostty surface per agent and talks to the daemon over a JSON control socket.
        </p>
        <p class="arch__note">
          That separation is what lets you quit the window and keep every agent running — and what
          makes a remote daemon behave exactly like the local one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="arch__diagram">
        <div class="node node--app">
          <span class="node__title">Clowder.app</span>
          <span class="node__sub">SwiftUI + libghostty</span>
          <span class="node__tag">renders</span>
        </div>

        <div class="link">
          <span class="link__label">JSON control socket</span>
          <span class="link__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="node node--daemon">
          <span class="node__title">clowder-daemon</span>
          <span class="node__sub">Rust · headless</span>
          <span class="node__tag">orchestrates</span>
        </div>

        <div class="link link--fan">
          <span class="link__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="leaves">
          <span class="leaf">agent PTY<em>worktree a41f</em></span>
          <span class="leaf">agent PTY<em>worktree 8c02</em></span>
          <span class="leaf">agent PTY<em>worktree d5e1</em></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .arch {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), var(--bg-raised), var(--bg));
  }

  .arch__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(300px, 0.85fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .arch__copy :global(strong) {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .arch__note {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    max-width: 52ch;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-deep);
    padding-left: 0.9rem;
  }

  .arch__diagram {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .node {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-bright);
    background: var(--surface);
    position: relative;
  }

  .node--daemon {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 40%, transparent);
    background: linear-gradient(
      160deg,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 9%, var(--surface)),
      var(--surface)
    );
  }

  .node__title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .node__sub {
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .node__tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.7rem;
    right: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    padding-block: 0.55rem;
  }

  .link__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  .link__line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--accent-deep), transparent);
  }

  .link--fan .link__line {
    height: 18px;
  }

  .leaves {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
  }

  .leaf {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-bright);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .leaf em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.56rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .arch__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
